c-text\" \n  \n></div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n\n      </div>\n    </figcaption>\n\n    \n\n\n  </figure>\n\n  \n\n</div></div></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-4 span-4\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/d740c743-4fc9-42bb-9507-922e2d686c23_1316/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/d740c743-4fc9-42bb-9507-922e2d686c23_1316/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.spacer\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_2_1510184713105_15946\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_2_1510184713105_15946\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_25_1510703167397_5080\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <h1 style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\">About Us</h1><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">\u201CSublime, warmly swirling...at once comforting and ominous\u201D is how SPIN describes the \u201Cintoxicating production\u201D of CSLSX. Since releasing their first single \u2018Futuretapes\u2019 in 2010, brothers Andrew and Chad Alburn, and frequent collaborator Jesse Davis, have earned widespread critical acclaim and pushed sonic boundaries with their unique blend of hazy electronic production.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Philly/Brooklyn duo continued their trajectory with 2012\u2019s \u2018Keep On Shining,\u2019 which Pitchfork lauded as a \u201Cbreezy electro gem.\u201D The strength of these releases would earn them opening spots for Grimes, John Maus and St. Lucia and garner continued attention cross influential media outlets such as Pitchfork, Spin, Fader and Stereogum.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">In 2016, CSLSX adventured out in a whole new direction, releasing the \u2018Ritualize\u2019 LP with Philadelphia rapper Lushlife, and working with such artists as Killer Mike, Ariel Pink, RJD2, Freeway and Marissa Nadler. The futuristic blend of shoegaze, hip hop and italo disco earned much critical acclaim, with Stereogum declaring \u201CI\u2019ve never heard anything quite like it. I recommend it highly.\u201D</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Now, CSLSX has completed production on what will be their debut solo LP, working with Grammy award winning producers Peter Katis and Nicolas Vernhes.  Look out for a release in spring 2021!</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>","website":{"id":"55e8e2d5e4b071dc30cae0c0","captchaSettings":{"enabledForDonations":false},"cloneable":false,"contentModifiedOn":1746549012913,"identifier":"chad-alburn-xhrr","imageMetadataProcessingEnabled":false,"isHstsEnabled":false,"language":"en-US","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"logoImageId":"59ff8e1de2c483f6d060ad58","primaryDomain":"www.cslsx.com","screenshotId":"7513d303626b8a445dee5fc3d92875915e94481bc09d6bb0bacfbf509dd2893e","shareButtonOptions":{"4":true,"1":true,"3":true,"6":true,"2":true,"7":true,"8":true},"showOwnerLogin":false,"siteDescription":"","siteStatus":{},"siteTagLine":"#Letsgetmetaphysical","siteTitle":"CSLSX","sslSetting":1,"timeZone":"America/New_York","typekitId":"","websiteType":1,"hasBeenCloneable":false,"statsMigrated":false,"authenticUrl":"http://www.cslsx.com","baseUrl":"http